@Employee_service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5070
@employeeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@dentistId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@serviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Listar funcionários (GetEmployees)
GET {{Employee_service_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar funcionário (CreateEmployee)
POST {{Employee_service_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-01",
  "email": "maria.souza@clinica.com",
  "phone": "(43) 99999-8888",
  "role": "recepcionista",
  "status": "ativo"
}

### Buscar funcionário por Id (GetEmployeeById) — substitua @employeeId pelo id retornado no cadastro
GET {{Employee_service_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Accept: application/json

### Editar funcionário (EditEmployee)
PUT {{Employee_service_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza Lima",
  "email": "maria.lima@clinica.com",
  "phone": "43999998888",
  "role": "administrativo",
  "status": "ferias"
}

### Remover funcionário (RemoveEmployee)
DELETE {{Employee_service_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{{employeeId}}

### Solicitar alteração de agendamento (delegada ao Dentist Service)
PUT {{Employee_service_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": "{{dentistId}}",
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "startAt": "2026-11-02T10:00:00-03:00",
  "type": "Private",
  "insuranceName": null,
  "insuranceCardNumber": null
}

###
